                            <h4 class="text-lg font-bold text-primary mb-2">Original Medicare (Part B)</h4>
                            <p class="text-sm">TMS is an outpatient procedure covered under Part B. Once your deductible is met, Medicare pays 80%, leaving you with a 20% coinsurance per session.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 p-6 rounded-2xl shadow-sm">
